# Never commit local credentials or machine-specific config.
# The disk template under disk/CONFIG carries only non-secret defaults
# (autologin, menu, theme). Anything holding a real key, token or password
# belongs outside this repository.
*.KEY
*.key
AUTHKEYS
SHADOW
SSH.CFG
EXTSVC.CFG
